OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol-related crime up more than
OL,4,A25% in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of incidents of
OL,7,Falcohol-related crime went up by more
OL,8,Fthan 25% in Plymouth city centre from
OL,9,F2023 to 2025, a report has said.
OL,11,FPlymouth City Council's cabinet agreed
OL,12,Fon Monday to extend a public spaces
OL,13,Fprotection order (PSPO) to run until
OL,14,FOctober 2029.
OL,16,FThe PSPO, which is in force across the
OL,17,Fwhole of the city, allows police
OL,18,Fofficers to ask people to stop drinking
OL,19,For give up their alcohol when officers
OL,20,Fthink it might lead to anti-social
OL,21,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
