OL,3,GNEWSAAlcohol-related crime up more than
OL,4,A25% in city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA report for the council said there was
OL,7,Fa "need for ongoing interventions that
OL,8,Faddress alcohol-related disorder,
OL,9,Fnuisance behaviour, and issues
OL,10,Faffecting residents, visitors and
OL,11,Fbusinesses".
